{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Isn't it tiring to go into the dungeon all the time to farm materials? So why don't we tame the monsters and raise them in our ranch?&quot;</strong> - <i>Archie &amp; Chloe Flamvell (player)</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graduating from the Artisan Academy, the bright minded twin decided to open up an Artisan Workshop with a farm that grows their own materials and a ranching monsters from the dungeons. Combining <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>RPG elements</strong>, taking care of the <strong>farm and monsters</strong>, and <strong>forming bonds</strong> with the villagers, the twin aims to become the best artisan the world has ever seen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love the idea of <strong>being an artisan and taming monsters in your farm</strong>, and want to be notified for the latest news, join us here </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561880?t=1741063325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/51cc705025761ae2698e3f51a3ba5fad8a433481/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741063325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/cc957052023a33ff34ceaf29f3cd5fbdac63dfb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741063325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/cc957052023a33ff34ceaf29f3cd5fbdac63dfb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741063325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ARTISAN STORY DEMO!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/extras/DemoTestAnnouncement.png?t=1741063325\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Isn't it tiring to go into the dungeon all the time to farm materials? So why don't we tame the monsters and raise them in our ranch?&quot;</strong> - <i>Archie &amp; Chloe Flamvell (player)</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graduating from the Artisan Academy, the bright minded twin decided to open up an Artisan Workshop with a farm that grows their own materials and a ranching monsters from the dungeons. Combining <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>RPG elements</strong>, taking care of the <strong>farm and monsters</strong>, and <strong>forming bonds</strong> with the villagers, the twin aims to become the best artisan the world has ever seen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love the idea of <strong>being an artisan and taming monsters in your farm</strong>, and want to be notified for the latest news, join us here </p>","developers":["Adventroupe Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2505510","name":"Artisan Story"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/c5cc235a0c4da2ff28e3b57573d5c09d970fc4f6/header.jpg?t=1741063325","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Artisan Story Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Adventroupe Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561880/509d2acf3a123c32d0cd9e4fc5864a74503